{"id":"6d2cf31c72d36b62","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-subsets.md","title":"Strict Subset Adapter","display":"df-subsets — Strict Subset Adapter","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-subsets","aliases":["58-df-subsets","Subset"],"display":"df-subsets — Strict Subset Adapter","depends_on":["[[../batch09/58-df-subset.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-subsets"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-subsets</span><span>Subset</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-subsets — Strict Subset Adapter"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d35b78cf8312c12b\" href=\"?note=d35b78cf8312c12b\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-subset.md\">../batch09/58-df-subset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md\">../batch09/58-df-powerset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in V\">\\(A,B\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StrictSubset}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{StrictSubset}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}subsets}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{StrictSubset}_S(A,B)\n\\leftrightarrow\nA\\subseteq B\\land A\\neq B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}subsets}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{StrictSubset}_S(A,B)\n\\leftrightarrow\nA\\subseteq B\\land A\\neq B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}subsets\\text{-}notation}\\vdash\nA\\subsetneq B\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{StrictSubset}_S(A,B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}subsets\\text{-}notation}\\vdash\nA\\subsetneq B\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{StrictSubset}_S(A,B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Non-strict subset and power set are already defined by the direct upstream atoms and are not duplicated here.</li>\n<li>The ambiguous glyph <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\subset\">\\(\\subset\\)</span> is replaced by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\subsetneq\">\\(\\subsetneq\\)</span> for strict inclusion.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch09/58-df-subset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d35b78cf8312c12b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-subset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StrictSubset}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}subsets}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{StrictSubset}_S(A,B)\n\\leftrightarrow\nA\\subseteq B\\land A\\neq B.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}subsets\\text{-}notation}\\vdash\nA\\subsetneq B\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{StrictSubset}_S(A,B).","display":true},{"tex":"\\subset","display":false},{"tex":"\\subsetneq","display":false}],"bytes":823,"backlinks